{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/c90d5d2d4bb3b1137829419360b9dcfa.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Outcast is a survival crafting action RPG. Survive in an unknown solar system. Seek out resources vital to keep your ship in working order. Discover plant life to farm before your supplies run out. Build farming outposts on planets. Research outposts on moons and resource depots on asteroids.<br><br><br>As a Captain of a transport ship you make long trips from the Moon to Mars and back. Delivering much needed supplies for the colonisation efforts. You wake up one day while on your way back to the Moon with emergency power active and alarms blaring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6624f37198fd5077467cf3a44b1d8d9c.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive!</strong> Take care of your oxygen, food, water, sleep and even temperature, radiation and gravity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/cee9c253fbe19694a94e275fa8eab599.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain your ship!</strong> Your ship will need hydrogen fuel to traverse the vast expanse of space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also oxygen to create a breathable atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/2afc384b6c1d0b2e7bda1570d58c20d2.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build outposts!</strong> Create a foothold on asteroids, planets, and moons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and Hunting!</strong> You will need to take care of your daily needs! Hunger and hydration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/d2bd36eb1d3728aa6ca93e54c4705424.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Cooking!</strong> Armors, Weapons, Tools and even upgrades for your ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create decent meals with the alien flora and fauna you encounter on your travels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/fd064fa5d3e936dfbe3d90a144accf9c.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore!</strong> An entire Solar System! Planets, Moons, and Asteroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And exploit it's resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/4217eebbf05d58592a7a8ad6369586ba.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word of the developer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hey everyone!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019m Steve, the solo developer behind <strong>Astral Outcast</strong>. This project started as a small weekend experiment and somehow turned into a passion project. Every mechanic, from being able to fly with your ship to how each world feels unique, was made with the idea of making something special.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Even if the game definitely takes idea's from other titles that gave me inspiration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a lifelong fan of Survival-exploration games, I wanted <strong>Astral Outcast</strong> to capture that quiet, mysterious feeling of being lost in space where nobody else has ever set foot before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019m incredibly grateful to everyone who\u2019s played the demo, shared feedback, or just followed the development journey. Your support keeps this little game alive. I\u2019m still learning every day, and I hope when you play the full release, you\u2019ll feel a bit of the love and obsession that went into every pixel and feature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thanks for being part of this journey \u2014 it truly means the world to me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 Steve (Developer of <strong>Astral Outcast</strong>)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord community!</strong> Join us on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug reports and updates are most frequent here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6af7ab81017f8ce35a2225adf67f3e90.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2568800?t=1764354969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764354969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/ab6c388e9dc81d4f8f1640f1bf045066723cf3b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764354969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/ab6c388e9dc81d4f8f1640f1bf045066723cf3b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176435496