l weekend experiment and somehow turned into a passion project. Every mechanic, from being able to fly with your ship to how each world feels unique, was made with the idea of making something special.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Even if the game definitely takes idea's from other titles that gave me inspiration.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a lifelong fan of Survival-exploration games, I wanted <strong>Astral Outcast</strong> to capture that quiet, mysterious feeling of being lost in space where nobody else has ever set foot before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019m incredibly grateful to everyone who\u2019s played the demo, shared feedback, or just followed the development journey. Your support keeps this little game alive. I\u2019m still learning every day, and I hope when you play the full release, you\u2019ll feel a bit of the love and obsession that went into every pixel and feature.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thanks for being part of this journey \u2014 it truly means the world to me.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 Steve (Developer of <strong>Astral Outcast</strong>)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord community!</strong> Join us on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug reports and updates are most frequent here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/extras/6af7ab81017f8ce35a2225adf67f3e90.avif?t=1764354969\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>","developers":["StarMight Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568800/header.jpg?t=1764354969","is_free":false,"linux_req